sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Controller as 🏛️ Exam Controller
    actor Teacher as 👨‍🏫 Faculty Instructor
    actor Student as 🎓 Student
    participant Portal as 🖥️ ERP Portal
    participant ExamService as 📝 Exam & Grading Engine
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    Controller->>Portal: Creates ExamTerm (e.g. "Fall 2026 Finals")
    Portal->>ExamService: POST /api/v1/exams/terms
    ExamService->>DB: Create ExamTerm & assign Datesheets + Room + Invigilators

    Student->>Portal: Downloads Digital Exam Hall Ticket & Datesheet
    
    Note over Teacher, Student: Continuous LMS Assessments
    Teacher->>Portal: Grades Assignments & Quizzes throughout semester
    Portal->>ExamService: POST /api/v1/lms/grades
    ExamService->>DB: Updates quizMarksCache, assignmentMarksCache on Enrollment

    Note over Teacher, Controller: Final Term Examination
    Student->>Teacher: Takes Final Exam in Exam Hall
    Teacher->>Portal: Inputs Final Exam Marks for Section
    Portal->>ExamService: POST /api/v1/exams/results
    ExamService->>DB: Create ExamResult & update Enrollment.finalMarksCache

    Teacher->>Portal: Submits Provisional Grades for Section
    Portal->>ExamService: POST /api/v1/grades/submit-draft { courseOfferingId }
    ExamService->>DB: Calculate Total Marks = Quiz(10%) + Assign(10%) + Mid(30%) + Final(50%)
    ExamService->>DB: Compute Grade ('A', 'B+', 'C', 'F') and GradePoint (4.0, 3.5, 2.0, 0.0)

    Controller->>Portal: Reviews & Approves Grade Sheets
    Portal->>ExamService: POST /api/v1/grades/approve-final { courseOfferingId }
    ExamService->>DB: Lock Enrollment status = PASSED / FAILED, isPassed = true/false
    ExamService->>DB: Recalculate Student.cgpaCache & totalCreditsEarnedCache
    ExamService-->>Student: Push Notification: "Semester Grades Published"

    Student->>Portal: Views Result Card & Official 8-Semester Transcript
    Portal->>ExamService: GET /api/v1/grades/transcript/my
    ExamService->>DB: Query all completed Enrollments grouped by Semester
    DB-->>Portal: Render Transcript with Term GPA, CGPA & Academic Standing
